  "referenceNumber": "QDi.280",
  "remarks": "Reportedly a member of Jama'a Nusrat ul-Islam wa al-Muslimin (JNIM, QDe.159) as of November 2023. Convicted in absentia by Algerian tribunal on 28 Mar. 1996. Algerian international arrest warrant number 04/09 of 6 Jun. 2009 issued by the Tribunal of Sidi Mhamed, Algiers, Algeria. Algerian extradition request number 2307/09 of 3 Sep. 2009, presented to Malian authorities. Father’s name was Benazouz Nail. Mother’s name is Belkheiri Oum El Kheir. Member of The Organization of Al-Qaida in the Islamic Maghreb (QDe.014). Photograph and fingerprints available for inclusion in INTERPOL-UNSC Special Notice INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice:https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals",
